over source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/964574/het-eeuwige-vuur.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000352860_Het_eeuwige_vuur_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T22:48:21.446Z","sha256":"131b666828b524ec50907ef851a2181f2b0a4d263ae407d44e78ab9d6f4d2019","bytes":91579,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"}],"work_id":2202,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":358,"text":"In het zestiende-eeuwse Europa raken geloof, politiek en persoonlijke verhoudingen nauw met elkaar verweven. Dit deel van de Kingsbridge-romans plaatst de stad en haar wereld in een periode van ingrijpende religieuze conflicten. De inzet van de strijd beperkt zich niet tot het verwerven van macht: ook trouw en liefde worden erdoor geraakt. Follett verbindt individuele levens met de historische spanningen die hun mogelijkheden bepalen.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/964574/het-eeuwige-vuur.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary"}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789493169517","key":{"isbn_13":"9789493169517"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":2204,"title":"De spiegel & het licht","isbn_13":"9789493169517","isbn_10":"9493169510","language":"nld","publisher":"Meridiaan Uitgevers"}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789493169517","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789493169517"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-02-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1232041/de-spiegel-het-licht.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1232041/de-spiegel-het-licht.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000606648_De_spiegel__het_licht_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T22:48:23.245Z","sha256":"c1c1b79d670c63af5bf2bfa1c655d7529ecd5267c9fcbade881d66bf0a47f3d6","bytes":409083,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"}],"edition_id":"@edition:9789493169517","work_id":2204,"bound_author_id":1086,"bound_title":"De spiegel & het licht","bound_language":"nld","bound_isbn13":"9789493169517","format":"paperback","cover_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000606648_De_spiegel__het_licht_0_0.jpg","card_cover_url":null,"evidence_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1232041/de-spiegel-het-licht.html"}},{"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","ref":"description:2204:nl","key":{"work_id":2204,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-02-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1232041/de-spiegel-het-licht.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1232041/de-spiegel-het-licht.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000606648_De_spiegel__het_licht_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T22:48:23.245Z","sha256":"c1c1b79d670c63af5bf2bfa1c655d7529ecd5267c9fcbade881d66bf0a47f3d6","bytes":409083,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"}],"work_id":2204,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":1086,"text":"Na de dood van Anne Boleyn probeert Thomas Cromwell zijn positie aan het hof van Hendrik VIII verder te versterken. Zijn afkomst biedt weinig bescherming en hij is aangewezen op inzicht en politieke behendigheid. Terwijl binnenlandse onrust en buitenlandse dreiging toenemen, blijft de gunst van de koning onzeker. Het slot van Mantels trilogie volgt Cromwell in een wereld waarin macht steeds opnieuw verdiend en verdedigd moet worden.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1232041/de-spiegel-het-licht.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary"}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789024570980","key":{"isbn_13":"9789024570980"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":2209,"title":"Gouden Zoon","isbn_13":"9789024570980","isbn_10":"9024570980","language":"nld","publisher":"Luitingh-Sijthoff B.V., Uitgeverij"}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789024570980","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789024570980"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-02-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/889536/gouden-zoon.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/889536/gouden-zoon.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000199526_Gouden_zoon_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T22:48:25.093Z","sha256":"49ff77a62966dfc2e3dc20e847a1860668d155c9ee2e3c179e2542e4405ac568","bytes":102595,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"}],"edition_id":"@edition:9789024570980","work_id":2209,"bound_author_id":157,"bound_title":"Gouden Zoon","bound_language":"nld","bound_isbn13":"9789024570980","format":"paperback","cover_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000199526_Gouden_zoon_0_0.jpg","card_cover_url":null,"evidence_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/889536/gouden-zoon.html"}},{"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","ref":"description:2209:nl","key":{"work_id":2209,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-02-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/889536/gouden-zoon.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/889536/gouden-zoon.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000199526_Gouden_zoon_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T22:48:25.093Z","sha256":"49ff77a62966dfc2e3dc20e847a1860668d155c9ee2e3c179e2542e4405ac568","bytes":102595,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"}],"work_id":2209,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":157,"text":"Darrow kent de samenleving van de Gouden inmiddels van binnenuit, maar zijn afkomst en doel blijven een gevaarlijk geheim. Hij wil de onderdrukking van zijn volk doorbreken en moet daarvoor samenwerken met mensen wier belangen niet vanzelf met de zijne samenvallen. Het tweede Mars-boek volgt zijn manoeuvres tussen vriendschap, politieke rivaliteit en verzet. Wraak kan hem in beweging brengen, maar vormt geen eenvoudig plan voor een andere toekomst.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/889536/gouden-zoon.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary"}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789021461151","key":{"isbn_13":"9789021461151"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":2211,"title":"Zo lief als de dood","isbn_13":"9789021461151","isbn_10":"9021461153","language":"nld","publisher":"Singel Uitgeverijen"}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789021461151","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789021461151"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-02-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1515874/zo-lief-als-de-dood.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/15