ader is. Het derde Moordgids-boek brengt haar onderzoek gevaarlijk dicht bij haar eigen veiligheid en haar vertrouwen in de mensen om haar heen.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1515874/zo-lief-als-de-dood.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary"}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789021053950","key":{"isbn_13":"9789021053950"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":2212,"title":"Morgenster","isbn_13":"9789021053950","isbn_10":"9021053950","language":"nld","publisher":"Luitingh-Sijthoff B.V., Uitgeverij"}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789021053950","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789021053950"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-02-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/968991/morgenster.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/968991/morgenster.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000679603_De_Mars_Trilogie_3_-_Morgenster_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T22:49:40.54Z","sha256":"1fb157b7ce9f232abb557bf8cfc4feaeca1d2273112c31d8c217020dbc397a2a","bytes":416033,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"}],"edition_id":"@edition:9789021053950","work_id":2212,"bound_author_id":157,"bound_title":"Morgenster","bound_language":"nld","bound_isbn13":"9789021053950","format":"paperback","cover_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000679603_De_Mars_Trilogie_3_-_Morgenster_0_0.jpg","card_cover_url":null,"evidence_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/968991/morgenster.html"}},{"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","ref":"description:2212:nl","key":{"work_id":2212,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-02-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/968991/morgenster.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/968991/morgenster.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000679603_De_Mars_Trilogie_3_-_Morgenster_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T22:49:40.54Z","sha256":"1fb157b7ce9f232abb557bf8cfc4feaeca1d2273112c31d8c217020dbc397a2a","bytes":416033,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"}],"work_id":2212,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":157,"text":"Darrow wil een samenleving veranderen die zijn volk als ondergeschikt behandelt. Zijn eerdere infiltratie onder de Gouden heeft hem macht en tegenstanders opgeleverd, maar de voorbereiding op een opstand vraagt meer dan een goede vermomming. In het derde Mars-boek moet hij anderen overtuigen hun verzet te delen. Daarbij botst zijn verlangen naar bevrijding met oude loyaliteiten, persoonlijke wraak en de risico''s van een gezamenlijk optreden.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/968991/morgenster.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary"}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789020679762","key":{"isbn_13":"9789020679762"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":2214,"title":"Dreiging en duisternis","isbn_13":"9789020679762","isbn_10":"9020679767","language":"nld","publisher":"Blossom Books B.V."}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789020679762","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789020679762"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-02-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1303972/de-grisha-dreiging-en-duisternis.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1303972/de-grisha-dreiging-en-duisternis.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000073354_Dreiging_en_duisternis_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T22:49:42.642Z","sha256":"f617405c1209875d7599187bf764a1d99d205ef085b73bdcfa67bf8f83bcbe82","bytes":110565,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"}],"edition_id":"@edition:9789020679762","work_id":2214,"bound_author_id":142,"bound_title":"Dreiging en duisternis","bound_language":"nld","bound_isbn13":"9789020679762","format":"hardcover","cover_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000073354_Dreiging_en_duisternis_0_0.jpg","card_cover_url":null,"evidence_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1303972/de-grisha-dreiging-en-duisternis.html"}},{"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","ref":"description:2214:nl","key":{"work_id":2214,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-02-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1303972/de-grisha-dreiging-en-duisternis.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1303972/de-grisha-dreiging-en-duisternis.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000073354_Dreiging_en_duisternis_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T22:49:42.642Z","sha256":"f617405c1209875d7599187bf764a1d99d205ef085b73bdcfa67bf8f83bcbe82","bytes":110565,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"}],"work_id":2214,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":142,"text":"Alina en Mal proberen buiten Ravka een ander leven te beginnen, maar haar rol als Lichtheerseres maakt verdwijnen moeilijk. De Duisterling blijft een bedreiging en haar groeiende vermogens brengen ook nieuwe verantwoordelijkheden mee. Terugkeer naar haar land vraagt om bondgenoten die niet vanzelf te vertrouwen zijn. Het tweede Grisha-boek volgt hoe Alina haar verhouding tot macht probeert te bepalen zonder haar persoonlijke verbondenheid met Mal te verliezen.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1303972/de-grisha-dreiging-en-duisternis.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary"}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789020679786","key":{"isbn_13":"9789020679786"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":2218,"title":"Val en verlossing","isbn_13":"9789020679786","isbn_10":"9020679783","language":"nld","publisher":"Blossom Books B.V."}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789020679786","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789020679786"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-02-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1303973/de-grisha-val-en-verlossing.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1303973/de-grisha-val-en-verlossing.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000116394_Val_en_verlossing_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T22:49:44.474Z","sha256":"042f0f139b1c1d23d20faa799ac9ff36fa44ea843ebe16f1dfc5733bdce89d09","bytes":90624,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"}],"edition_id":"@edition:9789020679786","work_id":2218,"bound_author_id":142,"bound_title":"Val en verlossing","bound_language":"nld","bound_isbn13":"9789020679786","format":"hardcover","cover_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000116394_Val_en_verlossing_0_0.jpg","card_cover_url":null,"evidence_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1303973/de-grisha-val-en-verlossing.html"}},{"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","ref":"description:2218:nl","key":{"work_id":2218,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-02-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1303973/de-grisha-val-en-verlossing.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1303973/de-grisha-val-en-verlossing.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000116394_Val_en_verlossing_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T22:49:44.474Z","sha256":"042f0f139b1c1d23d20faa799ac9ff36fa44ea843ebe16f1dfc5733bdce89d09","bytes":90624,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"}],"work_id":2218,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":142,"text":"Ravka staat onder het gezag van de Duisterling en Alina heeft maar weinig mogelijkheden om daar verandering in te brengen. Vanuit een verborgen onderkomen zoekt zij met Mal naar een nieuwe kans om weerstand te bieden. De zoektocht naar de vuurvogel en mogelijke bondgenoten vraagt om moeilijke afwegingen. Het derde Grisha-boek verbindt haar opdracht als Lichtheerser met de persoonlijke gevolgen van de macht waarop anderen hun hoop vestigen.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1303973/de-grisha-val-en-verlossing.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary"}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789021456645","key":{"isbn_13":"9789021456645"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":2220,"title":"Schakel","isbn_13":"9789021456645","isbn_10":"9021456648","language":"nld","publisher":"Singel Uitgeverijen"}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789021456645","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789021456645"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-02-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/484412/schakel.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/484412/schakel.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000114128_Schakel_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T22:49:46.372Z","sha256":"b25837158c4cb57e9cd11b418fb46f3947be5433574ee762b29dcb5472879c20","bytes":100823,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"}],"edition_id":"@edition:9789021456645","work_id":2220,"bound_author_id":165,"bound_title":"Schakel","bound_language":"nld","bound_isbn13":"9789021456645","format":"paperback","cover_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000114128_Schakel_0_0.jpg","card_cover_url":null,"evidence_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/484412/schakel.html"}},{"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","ref":"description:2220:nl","key":{"work_id":2220,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-02-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/484412/schakel.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/484412/schakel.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000114128_Schakel_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T22:49:46.372Z","sha256":"b25837158c4cb57e9cd11b418fb46f3947be5433574ee762b29dcb5472879c20","bytes":100823,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"}],"work_id":2220,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":165,"text":"Een pas gekozen congreslid krijgt een project waarvan de werkelijke bedoeling onduidelijk blijft. Veel later ontwaakt Troy uit een kunstmatige slaap in een wereld waar herinneringen met medicijnen worden onderdrukt. Wanneer hij die medicatie niet meer neemt, begint het verleden zich anders aan te dienen. Schakel verbindt deze verhaallijnen om te onderzoeken welke beslissingen en belangen schuilgaan achter de werkelijkheid van de silo''s.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/484412/schakel.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary"}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789021475240","key":{"isbn_13":"9789021475240"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":2222,"title":"Op één voorwaarde","isbn_13":"9789021475240","isbn_10":"9021475243","language":"nld","publisher":"Singel Uitgeverijen"}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789021475240","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789021475240"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-02-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1671008/op-een-voorwaarde.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1671008/op-een-voorwaarde.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000481382_Op_een_voorwaarde_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T22:49:48.201Z","sha256":"c73907fd927a1202014d74e4da947b9c0f82e59c735b5321c71f944a9c5087fd","bytes":615062,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"}],"edition_id":"@edition:9789021475240","work_id":2222,"bound_author_id":753,"bound_title":"Op één voorwaarde","bound_language":"nld","bound_isbn13":"9789021475240","format":"paperback","cover_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000481382_Op_een_voorwaarde_0_0.jpg","card_cover_url":null,"evidence_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1671008/op-een-voorwaarde.html"}},{"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","ref":"description:2222:nl","key":{"work_id":2222,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-02-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1671008/op-een-voorwaarde.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1671008/op-een-voorwaarde.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000481382_Op_een_voorwaarde_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T22:49:48.201Z","sha256":"c73907fd927a1202014d74e4da947b9c0f82e59c735b5321c71f944a9c5087fd","bytes":615062,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"}],"work_id":2222,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":753,"text":"Een bepaling in een testament maakt Declans zakelijke ambities afhankelijk van een huwelijk en een erfgenaam. Zijn assistent Iris biedt uitkomst door de rol van verloofde op zich te nemen. Wat voor hen als een praktische regeling begint, verandert hun dagelijkse verhouding. Het tweede Dreamland-boek volgt hoe lastig het wordt zakelijke afspraken en persoonlijke gevoelens uit elkaar te houden wanneer zij tegenover anderen een overtuigend paar moeten vormen.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1671008/op-een-voorwaarde.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary"}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789021475264","key":{"isbn_13":"9789021475264"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":2225,"title":"De laatste kans","isbn_13":"9789021475264","isbn_10":"902147526X","language":"nld","publisher":"Singel Uitgeverijen"}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":