ing, readable published front"}],"work_id":2231,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":154,"text":"De confrontatie met Het Herstel nadert een beslissende fase, terwijl nieuwe kennis over het verleden de hoofdpersoon onder druk zet. De grenzen tussen haar eigen keuzes en de bedoelingen van anderen worden steeds moeilijker te bepalen. Dit zesde boek in de reeks rond Juliette verbindt haar groeiende inzicht in zichzelf met de vraag welke positie zij wil innemen in een strijd waarin oude vijanden invloed blijven uitoefenen.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1242702/verbeeld-me.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary"}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789403129198","key":{"isbn_13":"9789403129198"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":2235,"title":"De man die twee keer doodging","isbn_13":"9789403129198","isbn_10":"9403129190","language":"nld","publisher":"Bezige Bij b.v., Uitgeverij De"}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789403129198","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789403129198"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-02-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1669065/de-man-die-twee-keer-doodging.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1669065/de-man-die-twee-keer-doodging.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000566864_De_man_die_twee_keer_doodging_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T22:49:55.732Z","sha256":"c965ea714c27ea095d3ff8587dddd4f0653f15a572c1074dc0db5a51196dcb42","bytes":297945,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"},{"reviewNote":"Prior title source JudithLennox/Dubbelleven rejected; exactRichardOsmanISBN9789403129198 source 