aderende oorlog veranderen de omstandigheden waaronder zij hun leven opbouwen. Het tweede deel van de Century-trilogie verplaatst de grote geschiedenis naar persoonlijke keuzes en verhoudingen. Wat voor de ene familie een mogelijkheid lijkt, kan voor een andere juist gevaar of verlies betekenen.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/263908/nacht-van-het-kwaad.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary"}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789000347568","key":{"isbn_13":"9789000347568"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":2515,"title":"Hof van mist en woede","isbn_13":"9789000347568","isbn_10":"9000347564","language":"nld","publisher":"Uitgeverij Unieboek | Het Spectrum"}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789000347568","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789000347568"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-02-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/766960/hof-van-mist-en-woede.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/766960/hof-van-mist-en-woede.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000509052_Hof_van_mist_en_woede_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T22:50:01.213Z","sha256":"9e1971fe8d366189d4c8bda856ce8b719dde1c9464624181580b969e64c32c45","bytes":416067,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"}],"edition_id":"@edition:9789000347568","work_id":2515,"bound_author_id":125,"bound_title":"Hof van mist en woede","bound_language":"nld","bound_isbn13":"9789000347568","format":"paperback","cover_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000509052_Hof_van_mist_en_woede_0_0.jpg","card_cover_url":null,"evidence_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/766960/hof-van-mist-en-woede.html"}},{"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","ref":"description:2515:nl","key":{"work_id":2515,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-02-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/766960/hof-van-mist-en-woede.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/766960/hof-van-mist-en-woede.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000509052_Hof_van_mist_en_woede_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T22:50:01.213Z","sha256":"9e1971fe8d366189d4c8bda856ce8b719dde1c9464624181580b969e64c32c45","bytes":416067,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"}],"work_id":2515,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":125,"text":"Na haar terugkeer naar het Lentehof kan Feyre niet eenvoudig verdergaan alsof de gebeurtenissen rond Amarantha achter haar liggen. Haar ervaringen, nieuwe vermogens en afspraak met Rhysand veranderen de verhouding tot Tamlin en de wereld om haar heen. Het tweede boek in Hof van doorns en rozen volgt hoe zij tussen politieke belangen en persoonlijke verlangens naar een eigen positie zoekt, terwijl een grotere dreiging zich aandient.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/766960/hof-van-mist-en-woede.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary"}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789022594476","key":{"isbn_13":"9789022594476"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":2519,"title":"Koekoeksjong","isbn_13":"9789022594476","isbn_10":"9022594475","language":"nld","publisher":"Meulenhoff Boekerij B.V."}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789022594476","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789022594476"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approv